{
  "set": "HW002_121_pp_finish",
  "controller": "Arturia MiniLab 3",
  "note": "Twelve pages: eight base pages on pads A1-A8, and four layers (Match A/B on A1, Kick EQ on A2, Match highs on A3, Match lows+mids on A4): press an armed page's pad again to flip to its layer. The big encoder steps through all of them. Faders pick up; knobs snap to the armed page.",
